msgid "Its own <0>builder</0> field is off, so the engine gives it none of these buttons. Four more abilities go with it: <1>canAssist</1>, <2>canReclaim</2>, <3>canRepair</3> and <4>canRestore</4> all default to whatever <5>builder</5> says, so as things stand this unit cannot help build, reclaim, repair or restore either."
